  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Pure Sodalis cultures were maintained in vitro at 25°C in Mitsuhashi-Maramorosch (M&M) medium (1 mM CaCl2, 0.2 mM MgCl2, 2.7 mM KCl, 120 mM NaCl, 1.4 mM NaHCO3, 1.3 mM NaH2PO4, 22 mM D (+) glucose, 6.5 g/L lactalbumin hydrolysate, and 5.0 g/L yeast extract) supplemented with 5% heat-inactivated fetal bovine serum (Beard et al. 1993)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}